    "diagnosis": "<p>Paget disease, with microinvasion</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Nipple shows focal surface erosion and a dense lymphoplasmacytic infiltrate in the upper dermis.&nbsp; The epidermis contains individual and clusters of high grade malignant cells indicative of Paget disease.&nbsp; Occasional small clusters of abnormal epithelial cells are found in the superficial stroma, detached from the epidermis, suggesting focal microinvasion.</p>",
